# Image TODO: hami-scheduling-chain-v1.png

## Purpose
A numbered flow diagram of the HAMi scheduling chain: webhook rewrites schedulerName,
hami-scheduler places the pod, and a side branch shows the hami.io/webhook ignore
bypass to the default scheduler.

## Composition breakdown
- Step 1 (left): a kubectl apply arrow sending a pod manifest requesting
  "nvidia.com/gpumem" into the cluster.
- Step 2: the pod passing through a "HAMi mutating webhook" box that stamps
  "spec.schedulerName = hami-scheduler" onto it (drawn as a label being written).
- Step 3: the pod arriving at a "hami-scheduler" box choosing between two candidate
  GPU nodes, annotated "accounts for gpumem + gpucores slices".
- Step 4: the pod bound onto a node's GPU alongside an existing pod, both sharing one
  green GPU chip.
- Side branch: a second pod labeled "hami.io/webhook: ignore" taking a dashed arrow
  straight to the default kube-scheduler, bypassing the webhook.

## Gemini prompt
Create a flat technical numbered flow diagram titled "HAMi scheduling chain". Step 1
on the left: a "kubectl apply" arrow sending a pod manifest requesting
"nvidia.com/gpumem" into the cluster. Step 2: the pod passing through a box labeled
"HAMi mutating webhook" that stamps the label "spec.schedulerName = hami-scheduler"
onto it. Step 3: the pod arriving at a box labeled "hami-scheduler" that evaluates two
candidate GPU node cards and picks one, annotated "accounts for gpumem + gpucores
slices". Step 4: the pod bound onto a node's GPU alongside an existing pod, both
sharing one bright green GPU chip. Add a side branch: a second pod labeled
"hami.io/webhook: ignore" following a dashed arrow straight to a "default
kube-scheduler" box, bypassing the webhook. Number the four main steps 1-4. Style:
flat technical illustration, dark navy background (#0D1117), electric blue (#2F81F7)
and neon green (#39D353) accents, off-white (#E6EDF3) labels, subtle hexagonal grid
texture at 10% opacity, no photorealism, no gradients on solid elements, clean
sans-serif labels, developer education platform aesthetic. Aspect ratio 16:9.
